grund.toml is read as version 2.

[schema.leads.words]
How many words a declaration's lead may take, by strength.

  must (integer): Words past which a declaration's lead is an error.
  warn (integer): Words past which a declaration's lead is a warning.
  should (integer): Words past which a declaration's lead is a suggestion.
  may (integer): A word guideline that is not checked.

Next: grund config explain '[schema.leads.words] must'
